<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.79 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.79 vs   0.32</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.93 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Sales		    6.04 vs   4.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.44 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.44 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.06 vs   0.08 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   13.77 vs  10.69</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
